                                                "sense_id": "cf4ecb40-2cbd-36d6-8f27-81c8d8e3e99c",
                                                "text": "Queen Mary of the Iron Road. By Fred C. Bishop. […] This is the life-story of a boy who was determined to become an engine driver, and who lost no time in realising his ambition. A bold plunge from a clerkship in a coal merchant's office carried Fred Bishop, at the age of 14, into the locomotive department of the London & North Western Railway."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "33f4b65f-790c-3953-b81e-4ebf2dd68b9a",
                                        "entry_id": "a05c26ca-6684-3e6d-9542-dc4eb1343548",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A long and detailed monologue delivered to someone."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "broadly",
                                            "figuratively"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
